delegate { new { issue = "CIT-516"; agent = "Claude"; ask = "Fix the capture script tutorial-app/evidence/cit-495-duo-left-page-v1/capture.mjs for both review findings, CIT-516 and CIT-517, in one container-use environment. CIT-516: dismiss the 'Cannot edit in read-only editor' notification before the screenshot so it does not cover the claim. CIT-517: make the capture exit non-zero when the page reports a runtime error, since pageErrors is collected but never checked. Regenerate the screenshot, run the duo-left-page spec, and reply here naming the environment so it can be shipped." } }
